        "encoded": "Your%20LangGraph%20workflow%20is%20not%20executing%20tools%20because%20**Ollama%20models%20don't%20support%20native%20function/tool%20calling**.%20The%20AI%20is%20generating%20tool%20call%20instructions%20as%20text%20(JSON%20format)%20instead%20of%20actual%20tool%20calls%20that%20LangGraph%20can%20intercept.",
