        "chunkId": "894720",
        "hash": "5b6376da",
        "encoded": "1.%20**Ollama%20Limitation**:%20The%20%60ChatOllama%60%20model%20from%20%60langchain_ollama%60%20doesn't%20support%20the%20tool%20calling%20interface%20that%20LangGraph%20expects",
        "prevChunkIds": []
