      "16": {
        "chunkId": "894720",
        "hash": "6d2c42a6",
        "encoded": "2.%20**Tool%20Binding%20Issue**:%20While%20tools%20are%20properly%20fetched%20from%20MCP%20server%20and%20bound%20to%20the%20LLM,%20Ollama%20can't%20generate%20the%20proper%20tool%20call%20format",
